	<key>readme</key>
	<string>Type the keyword (default: ccp) plus a few letters to fuzzy-search the top-level folders of your projects folder. Folders containing CLAUDE.md or .claude/ rank higher.

↩ — new Ghostty window in the folder, runs claude
⌥↩ — same, but claude --continue (resume last session)
⌃↩ — new Ghostty window in the folder, without Claude
⌘↩ — reveal the folder in Finder

Requirements: Ghostty 1.3 or newer and the claude CLI on your PATH. (Older Ghostty: the workflow falls back to ⌘N via System Events and then needs Accessibility permission for Alfred.)</string>
